[[Tripartite Louyan]] was the period between 1856-1952 after the [[Unification of Louyan]] between the three Louyan states of the [[Kingdom of Daigen]], [[Kingdom of Dzindu]] and [[Kingdom of Bingdu]], in which each kingdom would have a rotating [[Grand emperor of Louyan|grand emperor]] that served as the head of state every year. Tripartite Louyan had dissolved after the [[Republican revolution of 1952]], that had seen the formation of the [[Louyan|Republic of Louyan]]